WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:04,900
Today you go to Lin Feng’s place to work for me, Sister Weiwei

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,820
If she hates me so much, I'll go

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,020
She must not torture me to death

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:09,780
The wronged person has his head, and the stronghold has its owner

5
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:10,900
She hates me

6
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,070
You go and take a look for me

7
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,510
What does she want from someone?

8
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:18,300
If you don’t record it once you come back, tell me, but

9
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,340
No but

10
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,360
Emperor Ying sends you there

11
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,600
This is a mission accomplished

12
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:24,800
See you later

13
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:32,720
I can't do anything wrong to you. OK, I'll go to Zhou Ting.

14
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:34,780
Don't talk much when you go to Lin Feng's place

15
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,940
You do whatever she asks you to do

16
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:40,830
Don't go against her, you know.

17
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:42,910
You two just move your mouth when you sing together

18
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:49,100
I'm the only one who co-wrote it, Sister Ting.

19
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,140
Bon voyage

20
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:51,970
I wish I were the one to go

21
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:53,730
No, no, I feel sorry for you

22
00:00:56,770 --> 00:00:59,010
It's your turn today. It's interesting.

23
00:01:00,670 --> 00:01:01,790
Tell me what to do
